1
00:00:01,320 --> 00:00:02,520
I'll dope you.

2
00:00:02,820 --> 00:00:05,537
Have you so easily
forgotten that I bestowed

3
00:00:05,620 --> 00:00:08,032
you with part of Emperor Crimson's power?

4
00:00:09,820 --> 00:00:12,677
Now's your chance to
apply your unique talents.

5
00:00:12,760 --> 00:00:16,080
You have eulogy and the
arms of Emperor Crimson.

6
00:00:16,300 --> 00:00:19,600
Calm your senses and open your eyes.

7
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:22,400
I know you have what it takes to do this.

8
00:00:22,740 --> 00:00:26,920
Now look at your immediate
surroundings and peer into the future.

9
00:00:31,420 --> 00:00:36,580
I can't find it anymore.

10
00:00:36,820 --> 00:00:39,497
I'm not sure.

11
00:00:39,580 --> 00:00:40,657
I'm not sure.

12
00:00:40,740 --> 00:00:42,200
I can't find it.

13
00:00:42,340 --> 00:00:43,197
I can't find it anymore.

14
00:00:43,280 --> 00:00:44,110
GameStop.

15
00:01:00,740 --> 00:01:05,057
It's a dream that's a dream
that's a massive dream.

16
00:01:05,140 --> 00:01:09,880
It's a dream that I'm dreaming!

17
00:01:12,260 --> 00:01:13,400
I'll tell you,

18
00:01:13,540 --> 00:01:15,857
can you

19
00:01:15,940 --> 00:01:21,180
tell me?

20
00:01:22,640 --> 00:01:25,737
I just say, I'm thinking.

21
00:01:25,820 --> 00:01:27,257
I'm thinking, I'm thinking.

22
00:01:27,340 --> 00:01:28,417
I'm thinking, I'm thinking.

23
00:01:28,500 --> 00:01:29,330
I'm thinking.

24
00:01:29,413 --> 00:01:31,380
Break it and roll.

25
00:01:32,020 --> 00:01:34,400
Whoa, whoa!

26
00:01:35,320 --> 00:01:38,917
I'm going to go to the world.

27
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:39,830
I'm going to go to the world.

28
00:01:39,913 --> 00:01:41,677
I'm going to go to the sky.

29
00:01:41,760 --> 00:01:46,280
When I'm going to die.

30
00:01:46,900 --> 00:01:50,277
I'm going to die. Hell no!

31
00:01:50,360 --> 00:01:54,200
I'm going to go and win.

32
00:02:03,200 --> 00:02:07,460
Look carefully into the future
and predict that which shall be.

33
00:02:07,740 --> 00:02:09,280
Ten seconds from now.

34
00:02:14,720 --> 00:02:15,550
Birds!

35
00:02:15,740 --> 00:02:17,960
The birds flew by just like I saw!

36
00:02:27,120 --> 00:02:29,320
Boss, I think I found something.

37
00:02:29,540 --> 00:02:31,897
It was hard for me, but Eulogy found him.

38
00:02:31,980 --> 00:02:33,215
Ten seconds from now.

39
00:02:34,040 --> 00:02:35,360
I can't believe it.

40
00:02:35,540 --> 00:02:38,217
The guy's blending into the
cliffs to stay out of sight.

41
00:02:38,300 --> 00:02:40,160
But I can't see him right now.

42
00:02:40,340 --> 00:02:43,377
My bare eyes are useless as
long as he stays like this.

43
00:02:43,460 --> 00:02:44,500
That's Risotto.

44
00:02:45,080 --> 00:02:47,640
Somehow he's also able
to disguise himself.

45
00:02:48,340 --> 00:02:53,700
Of course, he's normally invisible, but
you saw him because of your foresight.

46
00:02:54,200 --> 00:02:58,140
Deep look a few seconds ahead
and see how he's going to attack.

47
00:02:59,560 --> 00:03:02,260
There he is he's on the move.

48
00:03:08,760 --> 00:03:10,300
What the hell!

49
00:03:11,420 --> 00:03:14,617
I've got some bad news boss in ten seconds

50
00:03:14,700 --> 00:03:17,641
scissors are gonna rip
their way out of my throat.

51
00:03:18,180 --> 00:03:19,417
Peace, Deep.

52
00:03:19,500 --> 00:03:22,280
Despite appearances,
that was not your death.

53
00:03:22,960 --> 00:03:26,078
Risotto is the one defector
who's eluded the Family.

54
00:03:26,400 --> 00:03:28,820
Dealing with him will result in injury.

55
00:03:29,300 --> 00:03:32,157
You must use those seconds
of knowledge granted to you

56
00:03:32,240 --> 00:03:35,299
by your foresight and deduce
how he will attack you.

57
00:03:36,240 --> 00:03:37,200
Will do, boss.

58
00:03:37,460 --> 00:03:39,257
He's definitely moving in for the kill,

59
00:03:39,340 --> 00:03:41,597
so there's no way he's
using a long-range stand.

60
00:03:41,680 --> 00:03:44,797
And so if my vision from
the future is showing

61
00:03:44,880 --> 00:03:47,197
a pair of scissors being
lodged in my throat,

62
00:03:47,280 --> 00:03:51,980
does that mean there's nothing I can
do to change my destiny, boss? Exactly.

63
00:03:52,420 --> 00:03:53,817
You've seen the inevitable.

64
00:03:53,900 --> 00:03:55,547
Now you must prepare for it.

65
00:03:56,420 --> 00:03:59,832
There is no denying scissors
will sprout from your throat.

66
00:03:59,920 --> 00:04:01,380
But see beyond that.

67
00:04:01,660 --> 00:04:06,380
Discover the method behind his madness,
and his weakness is yours to exploit.

68
00:04:07,280 --> 00:04:13,020
Once you do, move within two meters and
destroy him with Emperor Crimson's arm.

69
00:04:13,440 --> 00:04:14,740
Damn it all!

70
00:04:15,860 --> 00:04:17,680
There you are, die!

71
00:04:19,620 --> 00:04:20,450
Rookie.

72
00:04:21,860 --> 00:04:22,800
Then again,

73
00:04:23,020 --> 00:04:24,780
in all my years as a hitman,

74
00:04:24,960 --> 00:04:28,417
no one has ever been able to get
as close to yours truly as you.

75
00:04:28,500 --> 00:04:29,997
Well done for a fledgling.

76
00:04:30,080 --> 00:04:33,180
I'm curious, how did you know where I was?

77
00:04:33,880 --> 00:04:35,760
Your abilities are so unusual.

78
00:04:37,420 --> 00:04:39,560
Regardless, you must still die.

79
00:04:44,440 --> 00:04:45,480
Ah, damn it.

80
00:04:45,760 --> 00:04:48,037
How'd he manage to get them under my skin?

81
00:04:48,120 --> 00:04:52,880
He hasn't so much as laid a finger
on me, and I'd never open my mouth.

82
00:04:53,120 --> 00:04:56,037
I don't even remember catching
a glimpse of his stand.

83
00:04:56,120 --> 00:04:58,885
But these scissors are
opening up on their own.

84
00:04:59,300 --> 00:05:02,829
If I don't act fast, he'll cut
something vital in my throat.

85
00:05:03,180 --> 00:05:04,592
I've got to get him out!

86
00:05:12,380 --> 00:05:13,377
Those movements...

87
00:05:13,460 --> 00:05:16,040
I was on track to bisect his trachea.

88
00:05:16,280 --> 00:05:18,737
But from the way he put
his hands to his throat,

89
00:05:18,820 --> 00:05:22,408
he's acting as if he anticipated
the scissors would be there.

90
00:05:22,600 --> 00:05:23,860
He knows something.

91
00:05:24,180 --> 00:05:25,340
Better be careful.

92
00:05:25,840 --> 00:05:28,420
My next strike needs
to put an end to this.

93
00:05:29,260 --> 00:05:31,400
Eat shit, Katsune!

94
00:05:40,120 --> 00:05:40,980
Damn it.

95
00:05:41,320 --> 00:05:42,580
How does he do it?

96
00:05:42,920 --> 00:05:44,940
The boss is gonna lose his shit.

97
00:05:45,620 --> 00:05:48,091
How the hell does this guy just disappear?

98
00:05:49,420 --> 00:05:51,520
Regardless, he really got me good.

99
00:05:52,260 --> 00:05:53,680
I'm getting wobbly.

100
00:05:57,040 --> 00:06:00,017
Wait that's what's wrong, Deep?

101
00:06:00,100 --> 00:06:02,480
Were you able to see Risotto's attack?

102
00:06:04,740 --> 00:06:06,437
Sorry, boss. I'm here.

103
00:06:06,520 --> 00:06:08,497
Did you see it or didn't you?

104
00:06:08,580 --> 00:06:11,617
Your silence tells me you need to move.

105
00:06:11,700 --> 00:06:14,937
Provoke him into giving chase
and pinpoint his location.

106
00:06:15,020 --> 00:06:18,200
Don't fail me, you bastard! I'm scared!

107
00:06:22,000 --> 00:06:23,647
I'm ready for what may come.

108
00:06:24,020 --> 00:06:26,549
I swear he won't be
able to trick me again.

109
00:06:27,500 --> 00:06:30,820
Keikatsu, I'll get in range
if it's the last thing I do.

110
00:06:32,900 --> 00:06:36,777
Emperor Crimson has provided you
with yet another vision, hasn't it?

111
00:06:36,860 --> 00:06:37,900
What did you see?

112
00:06:39,700 --> 00:06:41,920
I'm asking you a question, Deep!

113
00:06:42,160 --> 00:06:43,160
What did you see?

114
00:06:46,900 --> 00:06:48,437
My foot, boss.

115
00:06:48,520 --> 00:06:54,437
I know what he's gonna do next and
it's he's gonna go after my right foot.

116
00:06:54,520 --> 00:06:57,437
And chop it off, no doubt about it.

117
00:06:57,520 --> 00:06:59,037
I have to prepare to lose my foot.

118
00:06:59,120 --> 00:07:00,640
What did you say, Deep?

119
00:07:02,660 --> 00:07:03,490
He's coming.

120
00:07:03,573 --> 00:07:05,457
I saw him out of the corner of my eye.

121
00:07:05,540 --> 00:07:07,297
You have to get to safety now.

122
00:07:07,380 --> 00:07:08,210
Wow.

123
00:07:08,293 --> 00:07:11,094
You saw what the future holds,
so why aren't you moving?

124
00:07:11,560 --> 00:07:12,560
Rysolto Niros.

125
00:07:12,880 --> 00:07:13,820
A hitman.

126
00:07:14,400 --> 00:07:16,518
All of his movements are calculated.

127
00:07:16,860 --> 00:07:19,919
He knows how he'll kill me,
down to the last detail.

128
00:07:20,260 --> 00:07:24,340
I can't even move my legs right
now, so running won't work.

129
00:07:24,720 --> 00:07:26,000
Razors, now scissors.

130
00:07:26,700 --> 00:07:28,577
He knew all of this would exhaust me.

131
00:07:28,660 --> 00:07:30,542
He was planning for this moment.

132
00:07:31,180 --> 00:07:32,010
Blast it.

133
00:07:32,480 --> 00:07:34,480
Dopio's chance at victory is shot,

134
00:07:34,600 --> 00:07:38,071
and it would take longer than
ten seconds to reveal myself.

135
00:07:39,120 --> 00:07:39,950
Mysteria.

136
00:07:40,033 --> 00:07:43,277
Losing a foot would be lethal
at this point in the fight.

137
00:07:43,360 --> 00:07:46,478
Finding a way to minimize
the damage is our best bet.

138
00:07:46,980 --> 00:07:48,797
Again, get the hell out of there!

139
00:07:48,880 --> 00:07:50,527
He's going to slaughter you!

140
00:07:50,880 --> 00:07:53,520
I mean no disrespect by saying this, boss.

141
00:07:54,420 --> 00:07:57,008
But if I try escaping,
he'll kill me anyway.

142
00:07:57,480 --> 00:07:58,980
I can barely move.

143
00:07:59,680 --> 00:08:02,457
Staying put will help me
figure out how he attacks.

144
00:08:02,540 --> 00:08:05,077
I've been consumed with thoughts
of him attacking me with

145
00:08:05,160 --> 00:08:08,337
razor blades and those damn
scissors he stabbed me with.

146
00:08:08,420 --> 00:08:10,960
However, I went about it the wrong way.

147
00:08:26,840 --> 00:08:27,960
There you are!

148
00:08:29,620 --> 00:08:30,600
His ability!

149
00:08:31,940 --> 00:08:34,411
He uses the iron that's in people's bodies

150
00:08:34,920 --> 00:08:38,017
and turns it into razor blades
that attack from the inside!

151
00:08:38,100 --> 00:08:41,697
That would explain my exhaustion
and the frog bursting into blades!

152
00:08:41,780 --> 00:08:43,300
I've got you figured out!

153
00:08:43,580 --> 00:08:46,237
You use your stand ability
to suck the iron nutrients

154
00:08:46,320 --> 00:08:49,237
out of living things so you
can make razor-sharp objects!

155
00:08:49,320 --> 00:08:52,077
And since the blades shot
out of the frog first?

156
00:08:52,160 --> 00:08:54,497
Instead of affecting us at the same time,

157
00:08:54,580 --> 00:08:57,109
you are creeping toward
me from over there!

158
00:08:59,220 --> 00:09:00,380
Damn that brick!

159
00:09:02,360 --> 00:09:04,720
That vision from the future was spot on.

160
00:09:05,240 --> 00:09:06,660
Someone did lose a foot.

161
00:09:07,180 --> 00:09:10,480
Hey boss, I'm beginning to
get how this hitman operates.

162
00:09:10,780 --> 00:09:13,486
We may actually come out
of this in one piece.

163
00:09:15,320 --> 00:09:16,150
Boss?

164
00:09:16,360 --> 00:09:17,654
Where did my phone go?

165
00:09:17,900 --> 00:09:18,920
I just had it!

166
00:09:19,760 --> 00:09:21,380
Did I drop it?

167
00:09:21,620 --> 00:09:23,400
No, that's just a frog.

168
00:09:24,900 --> 00:09:26,377
Oh, there it is!

169
00:09:26,460 --> 00:09:29,477
Now, how the heck did it
get all the way down there?

170
00:09:29,560 --> 00:09:33,020
It's underneath all these
rocks and covered in sand.

171
00:09:33,460 --> 00:09:34,577
This is insane.

172
00:09:34,660 --> 00:09:37,677
I've got to get to the phone
and report back to the boss.

173
00:09:37,760 --> 00:09:39,200
Oh no, did it break?

174
00:09:42,540 --> 00:09:43,370
Huh?

175
00:09:47,040 --> 00:09:47,922
Thank goodness.

176
00:09:48,380 --> 00:09:52,262
It's amazing how they can get these
phones so small yet so sturdy.

177
00:09:52,480 --> 00:09:53,310
It's me.

178
00:09:53,620 --> 00:09:54,997
You would be proud, boss.

179
00:09:55,080 --> 00:09:56,845
The bastard's as good as dead.

180
00:09:59,520 --> 00:10:00,400
Damn you.

181
00:10:00,900 --> 00:10:02,620
Well done, Doppio Mio.

182
00:10:03,320 --> 00:10:04,150
Bravissimo.

183
00:10:04,360 --> 00:10:06,537
Should I be the one to
put an end to this guy?

184
00:10:06,620 --> 00:10:09,417
Or would it be better to
wait for you to arrive, boss?

185
00:10:09,500 --> 00:10:12,400
The death of Rizotomiro must be swift.

186
00:10:13,220 --> 00:10:15,500
I'll snuff out the swine myself,

187
00:10:15,740 --> 00:10:18,797
but you must be within two
meters for us to succeed.

188
00:10:18,880 --> 00:10:20,440
I shall join you then.

189
00:10:20,660 --> 00:10:23,131
Your job in the meantime is to get closer.

190
00:10:23,880 --> 00:10:24,710
Right!

191
00:10:24,793 --> 00:10:26,120
You can count on me, sir!

192
00:10:27,160 --> 00:10:27,990
Huh?

193
00:10:32,420 --> 00:10:36,067
There's something inside the leg
wound, and they're squirming.

194
00:10:37,140 --> 00:10:41,020
Risotto's stand must live
inside of him. I see.

195
00:10:41,400 --> 00:10:43,812
You have the power to divine the unknown.

196
00:10:44,100 --> 00:10:47,394
You know what will be and
read my movements accordingly.

197
00:10:47,720 --> 00:10:51,677
There's no other way you could have
known how I'd attack or from where.

198
00:10:51,760 --> 00:10:55,880
Earlier, I surmised you were
nothing more than a helpless coward.

199
00:10:56,140 --> 00:10:59,320
But now, it's like you're
a different person.

200
00:10:59,920 --> 00:11:03,700
You stand here before me undaunted
with self-assured ferocity.

201
00:11:04,940 --> 00:11:06,528
Your face is different too.

202
00:11:07,420 --> 00:11:09,057
Those aren't the eyes of a boy.

203
00:11:09,140 --> 00:11:11,200
No, it's like there are two of you.

204
00:11:15,180 --> 00:11:17,380
Could that be what's going on here?

205
00:11:18,820 --> 00:11:19,650
Absurd.

206
00:11:20,020 --> 00:11:21,980
But now there's no doubt.

207
00:11:22,400 --> 00:11:24,576
I'm closer than I originally thought.

208
00:11:25,240 --> 00:11:28,820
Closer to the very person I've
been trying to track down.

209
00:11:36,160 --> 00:11:37,360
Two years.

210
00:11:38,220 --> 00:11:41,017
It's been two years since
you turned us into a

211
00:11:41,100 --> 00:11:43,982
bunch of frightened mutts
waiting to be put down.

212
00:11:44,480 --> 00:11:45,640
Now I see.

213
00:11:45,860 --> 00:11:49,677
Whatever the hell you are, it's far
more than our group bargained for.

214
00:11:49,760 --> 00:11:51,000
I'm sure of it.

215
00:11:51,180 --> 00:11:54,260
What I want to know is who you really are.

216
00:11:54,880 --> 00:11:57,100
I need to know your true persona,

217
00:11:57,420 --> 00:12:01,160
and I'll do whatever I have to
do to uncover your identity.

218
00:12:10,800 --> 00:12:11,920
Solido Naso.

219
00:12:12,200 --> 00:12:14,024
One of the boss's aliases, huh?

220
00:12:14,560 --> 00:12:15,390
Well, yeah.

221
00:12:15,680 --> 00:12:18,677
Why the hell else would he try
hiding his daughter so quickly?

222
00:12:18,760 --> 00:12:22,057
So we dragged our asses all
the way out here for nothing?

223
00:12:22,140 --> 00:12:22,970
Damn it!

224
00:12:23,800 --> 00:12:26,388
But if we can get our
hands on his daughter,

225
00:12:26,480 --> 00:12:29,177
we might be able to find
out who the boss really is.

226
00:12:29,260 --> 00:12:30,090
Tell him, bro!

227
00:12:30,173 --> 00:12:32,497
Ever since the thing
with Sorbet and Gelato,

228
00:12:32,580 --> 00:12:35,051
we've been stuck here like rats in a hole.

229
00:12:35,160 --> 00:12:37,513
Wonder who's even guarding his daughter.

230
00:12:37,860 --> 00:12:41,060
Since Pericolo isn't a
stand user, maybe Polpo.

231
00:12:41,640 --> 00:12:42,920
Then, let's go.

232
00:12:43,200 --> 00:12:46,024
Let's head over to Napoli
and ask him ourselves.

233
00:12:46,160 --> 00:12:47,200
Hold your horses.

234
00:12:48,760 --> 00:12:52,317
We should think through all our
options before taking action.

235
00:12:52,400 --> 00:12:55,837
I'm as angry as you are, but
forget about sorbet and gelato,

236
00:12:55,920 --> 00:12:57,626
and you'll meet the same end.

237
00:12:58,040 --> 00:13:00,511
Failure means certain death, so take heed.

238
00:13:04,000 --> 00:13:05,540
My blood's boiling.

239
00:13:06,160 --> 00:13:07,240
But I'll deal.

240
00:13:07,540 --> 00:13:10,860
Because he who cannot control
his emotions dies first.

241
00:13:11,160 --> 00:13:13,101
He reattached the foot I cut off!

242
00:13:13,500 --> 00:13:16,780
Yeah, I was right about you, Risotto Nero.

243
00:13:17,300 --> 00:13:20,560
I know all about your
standability and its magnetism.

244
00:13:20,860 --> 00:13:23,937
That's how you're able to control
your stand from a distance.

245
00:13:24,020 --> 00:13:25,079
Tell me I'm wrong!

246
00:13:25,520 --> 00:13:28,397
You manipulated the iron
inside my body so that I'd

247
00:13:28,480 --> 00:13:31,177
hack it all up in the form
of those razor blades.

248
00:13:31,260 --> 00:13:35,497
And you make yourself disappear by
drawing magnetized iron dust to your body.

249
00:13:35,580 --> 00:13:39,057
Then you use it like camouflage
to blend into the environment!

250
00:13:39,140 --> 00:13:41,160
How very astute. Fine.

251
00:13:41,360 --> 00:13:43,917
You may have figured out
how my metallic operates,

252
00:13:44,000 --> 00:13:45,417
but it really makes no difference.

253
00:13:45,500 --> 00:13:47,400
You're far too late.

254
00:13:47,880 --> 00:13:49,821
The damage has already been done.

255
00:13:51,080 --> 00:13:51,910
Iron.

256
00:13:52,020 --> 00:13:54,940
A fantastic element that
exists the world over.

257
00:13:55,420 --> 00:13:59,891
Not only is it prevalent in sand, but
it's also in mineral water and plants.

258
00:14:09,140 --> 00:14:13,300
Oh, and the healthy human body
contains traces of iron as well.

259
00:14:41,280 --> 00:14:42,398
What are you doing?

260
00:14:42,600 --> 00:14:44,953
You knew how he was going to attack you.

261
00:14:45,500 --> 00:14:49,120
YOU CANNOT LET HIM HURT
YOU ANYMORE, UNDERSTAND?!

262
00:14:54,080 --> 00:14:55,860
Boss, this is...

263
00:14:56,540 --> 00:15:00,060
You deciphered my abilities
and managed to sever my foot.

264
00:15:01,860 --> 00:15:04,497
However, the damage has already been done.

265
00:15:04,580 --> 00:15:07,580
Nothing you do will change
that immutable fact.

266
00:15:07,860 --> 00:15:10,837
Amounts of iron can be
found in great quantities

267
00:15:10,920 --> 00:15:13,677
in plants like spinach
and organs like the liver.

268
00:15:13,760 --> 00:15:16,940
And it's also a critical
component of the bloodstream.

269
00:15:17,920 --> 00:15:21,717
What do you think happens when the
body is suddenly stripped of its iron?

270
00:15:21,800 --> 00:15:26,120
In short, your blood turns yellow,
followed by you meeting your maker.

271
00:15:26,420 --> 00:15:30,277
The iron in your blood binds with
the oxygen your body acquires through

272
00:15:30,360 --> 00:15:34,713
breathing and carries it to all those
nooks and crannies inside your body.

273
00:15:35,060 --> 00:15:36,236
Without it, however,

274
00:15:36,360 --> 00:15:40,657
that life-giving oxygen can never reach
places like your fingertips and brain.

275
00:15:40,740 --> 00:15:42,720
To put it another way,

276
00:15:43,000 --> 00:15:45,397
now that you're nutritiously
bankrupt of iron,

277
00:15:45,480 --> 00:15:49,680
your body won't circulate oxygen no
matter how hard you huff and puff.

278
00:15:50,800 --> 00:15:54,200
You'll turn into a living
corpse before dying outright.

279
00:15:55,220 --> 00:15:59,280
Alright then, now that he's on
death's door, what shall I do?

280
00:15:59,620 --> 00:16:02,220
I could just wait until you die naturally.

281
00:16:02,980 --> 00:16:06,057
Conversely, since I'm a little
short on time at the moment,

282
00:16:06,140 --> 00:16:07,905
perhaps I should end this now.

283
00:16:09,960 --> 00:16:10,790
Boss!

284
00:16:11,520 --> 00:16:12,520
It's them!

285
00:16:13,160 --> 00:16:14,631
They're near the mansion!

286
00:16:14,940 --> 00:16:16,200
It's Pujerati!

287
00:16:16,440 --> 00:16:17,969
He finally showed himself!

288
00:16:18,060 --> 00:16:19,178
And he's not alone.

289
00:16:19,500 --> 00:16:21,900
Narancia and Abakio are with him. What?

290
00:16:22,380 --> 00:16:24,180
Damn it, Abakio's there!

291
00:16:24,400 --> 00:16:25,600
We're out of time.

292
00:16:26,040 --> 00:16:28,877
Deep, your next strike
must be the killing blow!

293
00:16:28,960 --> 00:16:31,660
Use your power to see
Risotto's next attack!

294
00:16:31,980 --> 00:16:33,451
I'm already looking, sir.

295
00:16:34,180 --> 00:16:36,777
Risotto's gonna ambush
me from my right side.

296
00:16:36,860 --> 00:16:37,697
After that, he...

297
00:16:37,780 --> 00:16:38,610
he disappears!

298
00:16:38,693 --> 00:16:40,480
I can't see him anymore!

299
00:16:42,000 --> 00:16:43,140
It can't be.

300
00:16:43,840 --> 00:16:45,480
What do you see, Deep?

301
00:16:45,760 --> 00:16:46,940
Hurry, spit it out!

302
00:16:49,440 --> 00:16:51,577
That bastard won't know what hit him.

303
00:16:51,660 --> 00:16:52,800
He's gonna suffer.

304
00:16:53,320 --> 00:16:55,017
Leave everything to me, boss.

305
00:16:55,100 --> 00:16:56,080
I have a plan.

306
00:16:56,320 --> 00:16:58,417
Right before my vision becomes reality,

307
00:16:58,500 --> 00:17:01,557
I'll knock that smug head off
his shoulders and crush it!

308
00:17:01,640 --> 00:17:04,740
Just like when I sliced
off his nasty-ass butt!

309
00:17:06,960 --> 00:17:07,790
All right.

310
00:17:09,200 --> 00:17:10,920
You must stay still, Dobio!

311
00:17:11,980 --> 00:17:14,320
Any act you make now will be in vain.

312
00:17:15,620 --> 00:17:16,540
Listen to me.

313
00:17:16,800 --> 00:17:18,212
Your life depends on it.

314
00:17:18,680 --> 00:17:20,033
Conserve your strength.

315
00:17:20,140 --> 00:17:22,837
I'm traveling to your
location at this very moment.

316
00:17:22,920 --> 00:17:27,840
In just a few seconds, I'll arrive to
dispose of Risotto. Few seconds? No!

317
00:17:28,100 --> 00:17:29,537
I don't have that kind of time!

318
00:17:29,620 --> 00:17:31,417
He'll be on top of me before I know it!

319
00:17:31,500 --> 00:17:32,330
Deal with it!

320
00:17:32,480 --> 00:17:35,245
Once I arrive, I'll use
my time-removal powers.

321
00:17:35,440 --> 00:17:38,037
That'll undo the horrid future
you saw in your foresight.

322
00:17:38,120 --> 00:17:40,117
But what if he offs me before then?

323
00:17:40,200 --> 00:17:41,900
I have to kill him! Deep!

324
00:17:42,080 --> 00:17:43,420
This is the only way!

325
00:17:43,700 --> 00:17:46,037
If you want to live,
you'll follow my orders!

326
00:17:46,120 --> 00:17:48,100
Your body has reached its limit.

327
00:17:48,280 --> 00:17:51,398
I will not allow you to
sabotage yourself in my name!

328
00:17:51,700 --> 00:17:54,347
Do you not understand
the position you're in?

329
00:17:54,520 --> 00:17:57,638
Risotto Nero will not let
you find him a second time!

330
00:17:58,640 --> 00:18:01,780
But if I can find him, boss, what then?

331
00:18:02,700 --> 00:18:05,940
What if I said I had a way
to pinpoint his location?

332
00:18:06,760 --> 00:18:07,590
You see,

333
00:18:07,673 --> 00:18:12,045
I now know that the bastard's gonna attack
me by pulling the iron out of my body.

334
00:18:14,220 --> 00:18:15,860
Here it is! His attack!

335
00:18:16,140 --> 00:18:17,897
If his stand is strong enough,

336
00:18:17,980 --> 00:18:21,660
if it has enough power to pull
the iron directly from my body?

337
00:18:21,820 --> 00:18:24,437
then the scalpel will show
me the source of that force!

338
00:18:24,520 --> 00:18:26,160
Gotcha now, Risoto!

339
00:18:26,920 --> 00:18:29,160
You're so painfully predictable.

340
00:18:33,080 --> 00:18:35,740
You knew magnetic fields attract iron.

341
00:18:35,940 --> 00:18:40,337
and thought if you detected the origin
of the field, you could track me down.

342
00:18:40,420 --> 00:18:43,340
That was foolish, as the reality is.

343
00:18:43,740 --> 00:18:46,577
What you detected was the magnetic field

344
00:18:46,660 --> 00:18:49,520
given off by my stand
in the foot you severed.

345
00:18:49,680 --> 00:18:51,974
You didn't notice, but I left it there.

346
00:18:52,120 --> 00:18:56,137
I did a lot of soul searching after
I was separated from my foot and

347
00:18:56,220 --> 00:19:00,097
knew I had to make the best of this
situation if I were to survive.

348
00:19:00,180 --> 00:19:03,820
Your body is essentially
devoid of oxygen at this point.

349
00:19:04,380 --> 00:19:07,177
As I mentioned, the damage
has already been done.

350
00:19:07,260 --> 00:19:09,436
You shouldn't even be able to twitch.

351
00:19:12,420 --> 00:19:13,880
You're different now.

352
00:19:14,160 --> 00:19:15,631
No more timid insecurity.

353
00:19:16,160 --> 00:19:18,977
Then there's the change
in your physique and

354
00:19:19,060 --> 00:19:21,589
your peculiar habit of
talking to yourself.

355
00:19:21,920 --> 00:19:23,460
It's all making sense.

356
00:19:23,700 --> 00:19:26,641
At long last, I've figured
out your true identity!

357
00:19:27,240 --> 00:19:30,720
16th century German philosophers
knew the phenomena well.

358
00:19:31,540 --> 00:19:34,920
So we're clear it's called
multiple personality disorder.

359
00:19:35,240 --> 00:19:37,240
In addition to one's mental state,

360
00:19:37,500 --> 00:19:39,760
sometimes one will exhibit changes,

361
00:19:40,040 --> 00:19:43,040
like an increase in strength
or change in language.

362
00:19:43,180 --> 00:19:46,417
To think I was foolish
enough to believe you were

363
00:19:46,500 --> 00:19:49,057
nothing more than the
boss's most trusted agent.

364
00:19:49,140 --> 00:19:50,700
But you're more than that.

365
00:19:50,960 --> 00:19:52,380
You're extraordinary.

366
00:19:53,040 --> 00:19:54,460
I can't wait for it.

367
00:19:54,680 --> 00:19:59,520
When death takes you away, what kind
of contorted grimace will you show?

368
00:20:01,960 --> 00:20:03,740
There's nothing you can do.

369
00:20:04,060 --> 00:20:07,240
I'm far enough back, and
you've no power to resist.

370
00:20:07,580 --> 00:20:09,080
Any hope you had is gone.

371
00:20:09,460 --> 00:20:10,300
I've won.

372
00:20:10,780 --> 00:20:12,560
This is the end for you.

373
00:20:12,900 --> 00:20:15,960
Send him to oblivion, Metallic!

374
00:20:36,700 --> 00:20:38,060
What? How?

375
00:20:38,980 --> 00:20:39,810
Risotto.

376
00:20:40,180 --> 00:20:42,960
I made sure that Doppio was aware.

377
00:20:43,280 --> 00:20:47,700
I told the boy that he no longer
stood any chance against you.

378
00:20:48,040 --> 00:20:48,920
Don't tell me.

379
00:20:49,660 --> 00:20:50,780
I knew it.

380
00:20:50,980 --> 00:20:52,804
The enemy already beat us here.

381
00:20:52,960 --> 00:20:54,957
Luckily, they're full of lead now.

382
00:20:55,040 --> 00:20:56,511
So much for their ambush.

383
00:20:57,040 --> 00:20:58,637
How dare you?

384
00:20:58,720 --> 00:21:01,920
Now that you've effectively
robbed my blood of iron,

385
00:21:02,160 --> 00:21:05,397
it's not transporting oxygen
to my organs like it should.

386
00:21:05,480 --> 00:21:06,640
Suffice it to say,

387
00:21:07,060 --> 00:21:10,877
your power has made it seem as if
my body isn't actually breathing.

388
00:21:10,960 --> 00:21:14,548
Which means the only thing Lil'
Bomber is currently tracking.

389
00:21:14,760 --> 00:21:17,177
So how many do the enemy number, Narancia?

390
00:21:17,260 --> 00:21:18,160
I've got one.

391
00:21:18,420 --> 00:21:21,244
There's only one person
breathing on that cliff.

392
00:21:22,140 --> 00:21:24,860
Is your stinking breath, Risotto?

393
00:21:34,080 --> 00:21:40,020
How interesting what Doppio witnessed
with his foresight actually came true.

394
00:21:40,780 --> 00:21:42,140
I was winning.

395
00:21:42,640 --> 00:21:45,400
Victory was within my reach.

396
00:21:45,820 --> 00:21:50,340
But you had to throw the scalpels, boss.

397
00:22:00,460 --> 00:22:02,057
They were accusing.

398
00:22:02,140 --> 00:22:04,257
Not always with a knowing.

399
00:22:04,340 --> 00:22:06,417
What is just fiction?

400
00:22:06,500 --> 00:22:08,417
Or what is the truth?

401
00:22:08,500 --> 00:22:10,517
They have a mission.

402
00:22:10,600 --> 00:22:12,517
They are the passion.

403
00:22:12,600 --> 00:22:14,937
But they dare to tell us.

404
00:22:15,020 --> 00:22:16,737
What's bad and what's good?

405
00:22:16,820 --> 00:22:18,177
Stand up.

406
00:22:18,260 --> 00:22:20,257
Join us.

407
00:22:20,340 --> 00:22:22,177
Come on.

408
00:22:22,260 --> 00:22:23,117
We'll see this.

409
00:22:23,200 --> 00:22:26,197
We are the power.

410
00:22:26,280 --> 00:22:28,217
Who's in the future?

411
00:22:28,300 --> 00:22:31,277
Cause we are the fighters.

412
00:22:31,360 --> 00:22:34,420
Just fighting for a ride.

413
00:23:58,300 --> 00:23:59,130
Thank

414
00:23:59,213 --> 00:24:05,660
you.
